{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p036c","title":"袁术数何颙罪陶丘洪为之辨","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p036c-account","label":"《汉末名士录》","text":"袁术数何颙罪陶丘洪为之辨","evidence":["xunyu-e-p036c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"指责","evidence":["xunyu-e-p036c-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0084","role":"辩护","evidence":["xunyu-e-p036c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"何颙生平","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p036c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-p036c-q","source_order":[10,206,"P036c"],"order":2480}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xunyu-p0084","name":"陶丘洪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p036c-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-31f1502dacdc020e14c0","layer":"pei","quote":"术常于众坐数颙三罪，曰：‘王德弥，先觉俊老，名德高亮，而伯求疏之。是一罪也。许子远，凶淫之人，性行不纯，而伯求亲之。是二罪也。郭、贾寒窭，无他资业，而伯求肥马轻裘，光耀道路。是三罪也。’陶丘洪曰：‘王德弥，大贤而短于济时；许子远，虽不纯而赴难不惮濡足。伯求举善则以德弥为首，济难则以子远为宗。且伯求尝为虞伟高手刃复仇，义名奋发。其怨家积财巨万，文马百驷；而欲使伯求羸牛疲马，顿伏道路。此为披其胸而假仇敌之刃也。’术意犹不平。","attribution":"《汉末名士录》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7f630716ca49b94707fb","start":192,"end":404,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
